          "image_source": "images/page_6_image_1.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.084,
            0.766,
            0.104
          ],
          "content": "Why are we trying to remove green tokens and not red tokens?"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.817,
            0.061,
            0.904,
            0.114
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_6_image_3.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.11,
            0.847,
            0.186
          ],
          "content": "But there are no tokens in the bag, because we start with an empty bag. Just as in the case of subtraction, to remove 2 positives from an empty bag, we need to first place 2 zero pairs inside and then remove the 2 positives. We need to do this 4 times."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.218,
            0.194,
            0.353,
            0.324
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_6_image_5.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.371,
            0.194,
            0.492,
            0.298
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_6_image_6.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.511,
            0.194,
            0.632,
            0.298
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_6_image_7.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.652,
            0.194,
            0.779,
            0.324
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [
            {
              "bbox": [
                0.307,
                0.339,
                0.694,
                0.355
              ],
              "content": "Remove 2 green tokens from the zero pairs, 4 times"
            },
            {
              "bbox": [
                0.45,
                0.358,
                0.551,
                0.373
              ],
              "content": "(–  4) × 2 = –  8"
            }
          ],
          "image_source": "images/page_6_image_8.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.387,
            0.845,
            0.425
          ],
          "content": "After removing the positives, 8 negatives are left in the bag. This is – 8. This shows that (– 4) × 2 = – 8."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.432,
            0.148,
            0.458
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_6_image_12.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.434,
            0.846,
            0.475
          ],
          "content": "？ What happens when both the integers in the multiplication are negative? How do we model (–4) × (–2) with tokens?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.48,
            0.847,
            0.537
          ],
          "content": "For (– 4) × (– 2), we need to remove 2 negatives from the bag 4 times. Since there are no red tokens in the bag, we need to place 2 zero pairs and remove 2 negatives, and we need to do this 4 times."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.22,
            0.545,
            0.372,
            0.676
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_6_image_15.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.371,
            0.542,
            0.497,
            0.667
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_6_image_16.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.505,
            0.541,
            0.63,
            0.65
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_6_image_17.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.646,
            0.546,
            0.776,
            0.671
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [
            {
              "bbox": [
                0.314,
                0.691,
                0.684,
                0.706
              ],
              "content": "Remove 2 red tokens from the zero pairs, 4 times"
            }
          ],
          "image_source": "images/page_6_image_18.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.445,
            0.71,
            0.556,
            0.725
          ],
          "content": "(-4) \\times (-2) = 8",
          "image_source": "images/page_6_equation_20.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.73,
            0.543,
            0.75
          ],
          "content": "8 positives are left in the bag. This is + 8."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.752,
            0.187,
            0.768
          ],
          "content": "So,"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.418,
            0.77,
            0.548,
            0.786
          ],
          "content": "-4 \\times -2 = +8.",
          "image_source": "images/page_6_equation_23.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.794,
            0.78,
            0.813
          ],
          "content": "So far, we have established the following results by using tokens:"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.418,
            0.816,
            0.508,
            0.833
          ],
          "content": "4 \\times 2 = 8 ,",
          "image_source": "images/page_6_equation_25.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.417,
            0.839,
            0.549,
            0.856
          ],
          "content": "4 \\times ( - 2 ) = - 8",
          "image_source": "images/page_6_equation_26.jpg"
        },
        {
